<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2106836588"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1720435309"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="フレグランス"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="茉ひる / RINZO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="フレグランス"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:25.624"><div begin="00:17.506" end="03:25.624"><p begin="00:17.506" end="00:24.144" itunes:key="L1">あなたに似たようなこの香り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗅到与你身上相似的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ni ta yo u na ko no ka o ri</span></p><p begin="00:24.145" end="00:29.706" itunes:key="L2">もしかして近くにいるの？ねえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">莫非你就在我的附近？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi ka shi te chi ka ku ni i ru no ？</span></p><p begin="00:29.707" end="00:33.146" itunes:key="L3">これ何度目の勘違いだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 这到底是我第几次搞错了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ko re na n do me no ka n chi ga i da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:33.584" end="00:37.157" itunes:key="L4">もうどこへ行ったの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你究竟去了何处呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u do ko he i 't ta no ？</span></p><p begin="00:37.158" end="00:40.152" itunes:key="L5">今会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我现在好想见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma a i ta i</span></p><p begin="00:40.153" end="00:45.371" itunes:key="L6">蘇る何もかも全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关于你的点滴皆复苏于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mi ga e ru na ni mo ka mo</span></p><p begin="00:45.372" end="00:47.865" itunes:key="L7">忘れられないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因我一丝一毫都难以忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu wa su re ra re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:48.161" end="00:50.148" itunes:key="L8">愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经深爱 却已分开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ta sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="00:50.149" end="00:52.153" itunes:key="L9">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们已经说“再见”了</span></p><p begin="00:52.154" end="00:56.193" itunes:key="L10">なんて受け止められない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我根本就无法接受的结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te u ke to me ra re na i</span></p><p begin="00:56.194" end="00:59.177" itunes:key="L11">だからもう一度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以希望你可以重新爱我一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra mo u i chi do a i shi te yo</span></p><p begin="00:59.178" end="01:01.195" itunes:key="L12">愛してよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次爱你</span></p><p begin="01:01.196" end="01:03.614" itunes:key="L13">忘れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我根本忘不了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="01:03.615" end="01:07.024" itunes:key="L14">I still love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依旧爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I still love you</span></p><p begin="01:07.417" end="01:13.152" itunes:key="L15">あたしにも貸してくれてた香水<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连你曾经借给我的那瓶香水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ni mo ka shi te ku re te ta ko u su i</span></p><p begin="01:13.153" end="01:15.165" itunes:key="L16">もう側にはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都不曾留下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u so ba ni ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:15.166" end="01:18.100" itunes:key="L17">名前は知らないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然不知道它的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ma e ha shi ra na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:18.101" end="01:23.317" itunes:key="L18">大好きだったこの香り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我曾经很喜欢那种香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da 't ta ko no ka o ri</span></p><p begin="01:23.548" end="01:27.297" itunes:key="L19">鮮明な記憶まだ色褪せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晰的记忆仍不曾褪去色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n me i na ki o ku ma da i ro a se na i</span></p><p begin="01:27.298" end="01:31.342" itunes:key="L20">今宛にできるのこれしかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在除了沉溺回忆我也别无他法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma a te ni de ki ru no ko re shi ka na i</span></p><p begin="01:31.343" end="01:33.430" itunes:key="L21">此処には居ないとわかってるのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明就很清楚你并不会出现在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni ha i na i to wa ka 't te ru no ni</span></p><p begin="01:33.431" end="01:35.690" itunes:key="L22">似たような空気吸うたび<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可每当闻到那阵相似的香气时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ta yo u na ku u ki su u ta bi</span></p><p begin="01:35.691" end="01:39.321" itunes:key="L23">あなたを無意識に探してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会不由自主地寻觅你的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo mu i shi ki ni sa ga shi te ta</span></p><p begin="01:39.618" end="01:43.106" itunes:key="L24">今はただ苦しいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明此刻只感觉得到痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha ta da ku ru shi i no</span></p><p begin="01:43.107" end="01:46.226" itunes:key="L25">依存してるだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我只能依赖这阵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i zo n shi te ru da ke</span></p><p begin="01:46.227" end="01:50.850" itunes:key="L26">薄れやすいはずなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明早就应该变得淡薄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u su re ya su i ha zu na no ni</span></p><p begin="01:50.851" end="01:53.920" itunes:key="L27">染みついたままの香り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却令人铭心刻骨的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi mi tsu i ta ma ma no ka o ri</span></p><p begin="01:54.195" end="01:56.253" itunes:key="L28">愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经深爱 却已分开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ta sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="01:56.254" end="01:58.231" itunes:key="L29">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们已经说“再见”了</span></p><p begin="01:58.232" end="02:02.246" itunes:key="L30">なんて受け止められない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我根本就无法接受的结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te u ke to me ra re na i</span></p><p begin="02:02.247" end="02:05.169" itunes:key="L31">だからもう一度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以希望你可以重新爱我一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra mo u i chi do a i shi te yo</span></p><p begin="02:05.170" end="02:07.243" itunes:key="L32">愛してよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次爱你</span></p><p begin="02:07.244" end="02:09.553" itunes:key="L33">忘れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我根本忘不了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="02:09.554" end="02:11.541" itunes:key="L34">I still love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依旧爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I still love you</span></p><p begin="02:11.824" end="02:13.908" itunes:key="L35">ねえどうして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 我为何还是无法忘记你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e do u shi te I can't forget</span></p><p begin="02:13.909" end="02:15.773" itunes:key="L36">I can't forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我忘不了</span></p><p begin="02:15.774" end="02:19.176" itunes:key="L37">離れ離れなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管已与你分离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na re ba na re na no ni</span></p><p begin="02:19.177" end="02:21.136" itunes:key="L38">お願いお願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是拜托了 只希望你还可以</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i o ne ga i mo u i chi do da ke</span></p><p begin="02:21.137" end="02:22.800" itunes:key="L39">もう一度だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次就好</span></p><p begin="02:22.801" end="02:29.750" itunes:key="L40">側に来て抱きしめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重回我身边将我抱紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ba ni ki te da ki shi me te</span></p><p begin="02:30.067" end="02:32.065" itunes:key="L41">愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经深爱 却已分开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ta sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="02:32.066" end="02:34.188" itunes:key="L42">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们已经说“再见”了</span></p><p begin="02:34.189" end="02:38.061" itunes:key="L43">なんてもういらないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我根本就不需要的结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te mo u i ra na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:38.062" end="02:41.086" itunes:key="L44">だからもう一度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以希望你可以重新爱我一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra mo u i chi do a i shi te yo</span></p><p begin="02:41.087" end="02:43.090" itunes:key="L45">愛してよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱你</span></p><p begin="02:43.091" end="02:45.810" itunes:key="L46">あなただけしか見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的眼中就只有你而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta da ke shi ka mi e na i</span></p><p begin="02:46.211" end="02:48.094" itunes:key="L47">愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经深爱 却已分开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ta sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="02:48.095" end="02:50.219" itunes:key="L48">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们已经说“再见&quot;了</span></p><p begin="02:50.220" end="02:54.107" itunes:key="L49">なんて受け止められない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我根本就无法接受的结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te u ke to me ra re na i</span></p><p begin="02:54.108" end="02:57.068" itunes:key="L50">だからもう一度<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以希望你可以重新爱我一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra mo u i chi do a i shi te yo</span></p><p begin="02:57.069" end="02:59.221" itunes:key="L51">愛してよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱你</span></p><p begin="02:59.222" end="03:01.876" itunes:key="L52">忘れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我根本忘不了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="03:02.185" end="03:04.131" itunes:key="L53">消せないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法抹消 挥之不去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke se na i no ki e na i no</span></p><p begin="03:04.132" end="03:06.057" itunes:key="L54">消えないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法消逝</span></p><p begin="03:06.058" end="03:10.167" itunes:key="L55">孤独に紛れた香り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">糅混于孤独的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do ku ni ma gi re ta ka o ri</span></p><p begin="03:10.168" end="03:14.130" itunes:key="L56">もう一度だけ愛し合いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只希望我们还有机会相爱一场</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i chi do da ke a i shi a i ta i</span></p><p begin="03:14.131" end="03:15.144" itunes:key="L57">だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以说 我根本忘不了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="03:15.145" end="03:17.778" itunes:key="L58">忘れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法忘怀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="03:17.779" end="03:25.624" itunes:key="L59">You still love me？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还爱我吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You still love me？</span></p></div></body></tt>